commit b0549b66a2d3f596d3c791d761f94376ca693ab5

C03: shell commands, own source, minimize/close all, tabs and per-app volume are known unsupported effects (LIMITS1677)

Ten open requests ask for effects the catalog has no operation for: running a command («ejecuta pytest», «ejecuta ls»), reading BAXY's own source, minimizing every window, closing everything, closing browser tabs and setting one application's volume («subí el volumen de spotify», which asked the amount and ignored the application). Six known_unsupported_effect_request contracts (shell.command.run, self.source.read, window.minimize.all, window.close.all, browser.tab.close, audio.app.volume) close the turn as a plain limit naming the request; a known effect with no operation has no field to clarify, so the clarification resolver yields to it; «run»/«execute» are request heads.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


